msgstr "Enables the collapsible right sidebar in the editor to inspect and configure element IDs, names, documentation, and technical execution properties."

msgid "Interactive Guide & BPMN-Quest (Tutorial)"
msgstr "Interactive Guide & BPMN-Quest (Tutorial)"

